msgstr "``channel=<int>`` -- saluran AP."

#: ../../library/network.WLAN.rst:208
msgid "``ssid=<str>`` / ``essid=<str>`` -- AP SSID."
msgstr "``ssid=<str>`` / ``essid=<str>`` -- SSID AP."

#: ../../library/network.WLAN.rst:209
msgid "``key=<str>`` / ``password=<str>`` -- AP pre-shared key."
msgstr ""
"``key=<str>`` / ``password=<str>`` -- kunci yang telah dibagikan sebelumnya "
"untuk AP."

#: ../../library/network.WLAN.rst:210
msgid "``security=<int>`` -- AP auth mode (one of :data:`SEC_*`)."
msgstr "``security=<int>`` -- mode auth AP (salah satu dari :data:`SEC_*`\\ )."

#: ../../library/network.WLAN.rst:211
msgid ""
"``pm=<int>`` -- power management mode (one of :data:`PM_NONE`, "
":data:`PM_PERFORMANCE`, :data:`PM_POWERSAVE`)."
msgstr ""
"``pm=<int>`` -- mode manajemen daya (salah satu dari :data:`PM_NONE`\\ , "
":data:`PM_PERFORMANCE`\\ , :data:`PM_POWERSAVE`\\ )."

#: ../../library/network.WLAN.rst:214
msgid "``monitor=<int>`` -- enable monitor / all-multicast mode."
msgstr "``monitor=<int>`` -- aktifkan mode monitor / all-multicast."

#: ../../library/network.WLAN.rst:215
msgid "``txpower=<int>`` -- transmit power in dBm."
msgstr "``txpower=<int>`` -- daya pancar dalam dBm."

#: ../../library/network.WLAN.rst:216
msgid "``trace=<int>`` -- internal driver trace bitmask."
msgstr "``trace=<int>`` -- bitmask jejak driver internal."

#: ../../library/network.WLAN.rst:217
msgid ""
"``hostname=<str>`` -- DHCP/mDNS hostname. **Deprecated**; use "
":func:`network.hostname` instead."
msgstr ""
"``hostname=<str>`` -- nama host DHCP/mDNS. **Tidak dianjurkan**\\ ; gunakan "
":func:`network.hostname` sebagai gantinya."

#: ../../library/network.WLAN.rst:220
msgid "**NINA driver -- gettable parameters:**"
msgstr "**Driver NINA -- parameter yang dapat dibaca:**"

#: ../../library/network.WLAN.rst:222
msgid "``\"ssid\"`` -- the current SSID (string)."
msgstr "``\"ssid\"`` -- SSID saat ini (string)."

#: ../../library/network.WLAN.rst:223
msgid "``\"security\"`` -- the AP's auth mode."
msgstr "``\"security\"`` -- mode auth AP."

#: ../../library/network.WLAN.rst:224
msgid "``\"mac\"`` / ``\"bssid\"`` -- interface MAC address (6 ``bytes``)."
msgstr "``\"mac\"`` / ``\"bssid\"`` -- alamat MAC antarmuka (6 ``bytes``\\ )."

#: ../../library/network.WLAN.rst:226
msgid "``\"fw_version\"`` -- a 3-tuple ``(major, minor, patch)``."
msgstr "``\"fw_version\"`` -- 3-tuple ``(major, minor, patch)``\\ ."

#: ../../library/network.WLAN.rst:228
msgid ""
"**NINA driver -- settable parameters:** the call forwards to :meth:`connect`"
" and accepts the same keyword arguments (``ssid``, ``key``, ``security``, "
"``channel``). Only valid on the AP interface."
msgstr ""
"**Driver NINA -- parameter yang dapat diatur:** panggilan diteruskan ke "
":meth:`connect` dan menerima argumen kata kunci yang sama (\\ ``ssid``\\ , "
"``key``\\ , ``security``\\ , ``channel``\\ ). Hanya valid pada antarmuka AP."

#: ../../library/network.WLAN.rst:235
msgid ""
"Power-cycle the WiFi MCU and release every resource the driver holds "
"(firmware buffers, lwIP netif, SPI/SDIO bus). After calling this the "
":class:`WLAN` object must be reconstructed before use. Use this rather than "
":meth:`active` ``(False)`` when you need a full reset (for example, before "
"re-flashing the radio's firmware or to recover from a wedged driver state). "
"CYW43 only."
msgstr ""
"Matikan daya MCU WiFi dan lepaskan setiap sumber daya yang dipegang driver "
"(buffer firmware, lwIP netif, bus SPI/SDIO). Setelah memanggil ini, objek "
":class:`WLAN` harus direkonstruksi sebelum digunakan. Gunakan ini daripada "
":meth:`active` ``(False)`` saat Anda membutuhkan reset penuh (misalnya, "
"sebelum me-reflash firmware radio atau untuk memulihkan dari status driver "
"yang tersangkut). Hanya CYW43."

#: ../../library/network.WLAN.rst:245
msgid ""
"Inject the raw Ethernet frame ``buf`` directly into the driver's transmit "
"path, bypassing the IP stack. Intended for L2-only consumers -- bridging, "
"custom EtherType protocols, and similar. The frame must include "
"destination/source MAC and EtherType (no FCS -- the hardware appends it). "
"CYW43 only."
msgstr ""
"Injeksikan frame Ethernet mentah ``buf`` langsung ke jalur transmisi driver,"
" melewati tumpukan IP. Ditujukan untuk konsumen hanya-L2 -- bridging, "
"protokol EtherType kustom, dan sejenisnya. Frame harus mencakup MAC "
"tujuan/sumber dan EtherType (tanpa FCS -- hardware menambahkannya). Hanya "
"CYW43."

#: ../../library/network.WLAN.rst:253
msgid ""
"Issue a driver-specific control command. ``cmd`` is the numeric ioctl code "
"defined by the underlying radio firmware and ``buf`` is a mutable buffer "
"used for both the command payload and the response. The set of valid ``cmd``"
" values is driver-specific and not portable between CYW43 and NINA. Used "
"mostly by low-level test scripts and chip-bring-up code."
msgstr ""
"Keluarkan perintah kontrol spesifik driver. ``cmd`` adalah kode ioctl "
"numerik yang didefinisikan oleh firmware radio yang mendasarinya dan ``buf``"
" adalah buffer yang dapat diubah yang digunakan untuk payload perintah dan "
"respons. Kumpulan nilai ``cmd`` yang valid spesifik untuk driver dan tidak "
"portabel antara CYW43 dan NINA. Digunakan sebagian besar oleh skrip uji "
"level rendah dan kode chip-bring-up."

#: ../../library/network.WLAN.rst:261
msgid "Constants"
msgstr "Konstanta"

#: ../../library/network.WLAN.rst:266
msgid ""
"Station / client interface identifier. Pass to the constructor to select STA"
" mode."
msgstr ""
"Pengidentifikasi antarmuka stasiun / klien. Berikan ke konstruktor untuk "
"memilih mode STA."

#: ../../library/network.WLAN.rst:272
msgid ""
"Access-point interface identifier. Pass to the constructor to select AP "
"mode."
msgstr ""
"Pengidentifikasi antarmuka titik akses. Berikan ke konstruktor untuk memilih"
" mode AP."

#: ../../library/network.WLAN.rst:278
msgid "Security value for an unencrypted network. Available on both drivers."
msgstr ""
"Nilai keamanan untuk jaringan tidak terenkripsi. Tersedia di kedua driver."

#: ../../library/network.WLAN.rst:284
msgid ""
"Security value for WPA / WPA2 with a pre-shared key. The default when a key "
"is supplied to :meth:`connect`. Available on both drivers."
msgstr ""
"Nilai keamanan untuk WPA / WPA2 dengan kunci yang telah dibagikan "
"sebelumnya. Default saat kunci disediakan ke :meth:`connect`\\ . Tersedia di"
" kedua driver."

#: ../../library/network.WLAN.rst:291
msgid "Security value for WPA3 (SAE) with a pre-shared key. CYW43-only."
msgstr ""
"Nilai keamanan untuk WPA3 (SAE) dengan kunci yang telah dibagikan "
"sebelumnya. Hanya CYW43."

#: ../../library/network.WLAN.rst:297
msgid "Security value for the WPA2 / WPA3 transition mode. CYW43-only."
msgstr "Nilai keamanan untuk mode transisi WPA2 / WPA3. Hanya CYW43."

#: ../../library/network.WLAN.rst:303
msgid ""
"Security value for WEP (Wired Equivalent Privacy). Provided for "
"compatibility with legacy access points -- WEP is cryptographically broken "
"and should not be used on new deployments. NINA-only."
msgstr ""
"Nilai keamanan untuk WEP (Wired Equivalent Privacy). Disediakan untuk "
"kompatibilitas dengan titik akses lama -- WEP telah rusak secara "
"kriptografis dan tidak boleh digunakan pada penerapan baru. Hanya NINA."

